  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "感應到<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>的存在後，\n一部分的電源啟動了……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "611F61C95230001000020100000076845B5857285F8CFF0C000A4E0090E85206768496FB6E90555F52D54E8620262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "進行安全檢查……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n確認到相應的超級石……\n重新啟動部分系統。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9032884C5B8951686AA267E52026202600100001BE01000A78BA8A8D523076F861C976848D857D1A77F320262026000A91CD65B0555F52D590E852067CFB7D7130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啟動專案：M。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n此為高危險專案，\n確定要解鎖嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "555F52D55C086848FF1A004D300200100001BE01000A6B6470BA9AD8537196AA5C086848FF0C000A78BA5B9A898189E3939655CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "解鎖",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89E393960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>啊，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這是在幹什麼？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA0010000201000000554AFF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39019662F57285E794EC09EBCFF1F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然想挑戰\n超夢這種危險的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF713660F363116230000A8D85592290197A2E537196AA76845BF653EF5922300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可一定要捉住牠啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4E005B9A898163494F4F7260554AFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可一定要捉住超夢啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4E005B9A898163494F4F8D855922554AFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謬！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B2CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是要<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳務必\n捉住那隻超夢耶！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F898100100003110000FF01014F6059B352D95FC5000A63494F4F90A396BB8D8559228036FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是要<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳務必\n捉住那隻超夢耶！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n別因為自己很強，就把牠打倒了啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F898100100003110000FF01014F6059B352D95FC5000A63494F4F90A396BB8D8559228036FF0100100001BE00000A522556E070BA81EA5DF15F885F37FF0C5C31628A7260625350124E86554AFF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我捉住牠了。\n等一下下喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B621163494F4F72604E863002000A7B494E004E0B4E0B5594300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "每次看到這裡的狀況，\n就會讓我有種難以言喻的心情。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BCF6B21770B5230901988E1768472C06CC1FF0C000A5C3167038B93621167097A2E96E34EE58A0055BB76845FC360C5300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "光是通話也太無趣了，\n所以我就試試全像通訊囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5149662F901A8A714E5F592A71218DA34E86FF0C000A62404EE562115C318A668A66516850CF901A8A0A56C9300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到底有什麼樣的故事，\n搞得要在弗拉達利研究所和超夢對戰，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我這就來為<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說明一番吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52305E9567094EC09EBC6A23768465454E8BFF0C000A641E5F97898157285F1762C99054522978147A766240548C8D8559225C0D6230FF0C00100001BE00000A621190195C314F8670BA00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAA660E4E00756A5427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託妳了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A1759B34E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "難道妳很閒？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96E3905359B35F889592FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很好很好，\n人就是要直爽。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88597D5F88597DFF0C000A4EBA5C31662F898176F4723D300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的回答很新穎，\n但我不介意。這就說明給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳聽吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713600100003110000FF01014F6059B3768456DE7B545F8865B07A4EFF0C000A4F4662114E0D4ECB610F300290195C318AAA660E7D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3807D5427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超夢是由研究寶可夢基因的\n科學家手中所誕生的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D855922662F753178147A765BF653EF592257FA56E07684000A79D15B785BB6624B4E2D62408A95751F76845BF653EF5922300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠深藏著強大的能量，\n令閃焰隊也密切關心著有沒有可能<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n將牠納入最終兵器。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72606DF185CF84575F375927768480FD91CFFF0C000A4EE495837130968A4E5F5BC6520795DC5FC3845767096C92670953EF80FD00100001BE00000A5C0772607D0D516567007D4251755668300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就在那時，閃焰隊得到了超夢出現在\n卡洛斯地區某個無名洞窟的情報，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n於是就去捉住了牠。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31572890A36642FF0C95837130968A5F9752304E868D85592251FA73FE5728000A53616D1B65AF5730534067D0500B7121540D6D1E7A9F768460C55831FF0C00100001BE00000A65BC662F5C3153BB63494F4F4E867260300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為什麼超夢會出現在卡洛斯地區，\n目前仍是個謎。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4EC09EBC8D855922670351FA73FE572853616D1B65AF57305340FF0C000A76EE524D4ECD662F500B8B0E300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "曾經有一說指出牠可能是\n在追尋超級進化的能力，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但即使我們5個人合作，\n也沒辦法解開這個關於超夢的謎題。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66FE7D9367094E008AAA630751FA726053EF80FD662F000A57288FFD5C0B8D857D1A90325316768480FD529BFF0C00100001BE01000A4F4653734F7F621150110035500B4EBA54084F5CFF0C000A4E5F6C928FA66CD589E3958B9019500B95DC65BC8D85592276848B0E984C300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為就算我們使用了超夢進化石X和\n超夢進化石Y這兩種超級石，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n超夢也沒有超級進化。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA5C317B97621150114F7F75284E868D8559229032531677F30058548C000A8D8559229032531677F30059901951697A2E8D857D1A77F3FF0C00100001BE00000A8D8559224E5F6C9267098D857D1A90325316300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且為了儲存能量以備戰鬥，\n超夢牠平時又是靜止不動的……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1470BA4E8651325B5880FD91CF4EE5509962309B25FF0C000A8D85592272605E73664253C8662F975C6B624E0D52D576842026202600100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是專案：M就這樣凍結了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F5C086848FF1A004D5C3190196A2351CD7D504E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說到謎題，這次超夢為什麼會有反應，\n也算是個謎呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA52308B0E984CFF0C90196B218D85592270BA4EC09EBC6703670953CD61C9FF0C000A4E5F7B97662F500B8B0E5462300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然牠可能是對<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳擁有的\n超夢進化石X和超夢進化石Y<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n產生了反應。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136726053EF80FD662F5C0D00100003110000FF01014F6059B364C167097684000A8D8559229032531677F30058548C8D8559229032531677F3005900100001BE00000A7522751F4E8653CD61C9300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但這麼一來，問題就會延伸到\n為什麼<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳會擁有那2個超級石。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這實在是太不可思議了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4690199EBC4E004F86FF0C554F984C5C3167035EF64F385230000A70BA4EC09EBC00100003110000FF01014F6059B3670364C1670990A30032500B8D857D1A77F3300200100001BE00000A90195BE65728662F592A4E0D53EF601D8B704E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎，算了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CEFF0C7B974E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這麼強大的訓練家，\n超夢應該也會心服聽話。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF00100003110000FF01014F6059B390199EBC5F37592776848A137DF45BB6FF0C000A8D85592261C98A724E5F67035FC3670D807D8A71300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且，我這個代理所長手邊的事情也不少。\n那就這樣囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14FF0C62119019500B4EE3740662409577624B908A76844E8B60C54E5F4E0D5C113002000A90A35C3190196A2356C9FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    }
  ],
